Audit complete: **FAIL / NOT_LEGIT**.

The general proof relies on unconnected, answer-bearing `fruitSentenceCodes` and `decimalCodes` abstractions. Bridge-free execution gets stuck, while opposite interpretations prove incorrect results.

Detailed review: [REVIEW.md](/audit-output/REVIEW.md)  
Evidence and commands: [evidence](/audit-output/evidence/COMMANDS.md)
